return {h=4,w=65,cr=190,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"monster"},st={50,50,95,40,50,35},ab={{69,0},{31,0},{4,1}},genus={en="Lonely Pokémon",es="Pokémon Solitario",pt="Pokémon Solitário"},flavor={en={[1]="Because it never removes its skull helmet, no one has ever seen this Pokémon's real face.",[2]="Because it never removes its skull helmet, no one has ever seen this Pokémon's real face.",[3]="Wears the skull of its deceased mother. Its cries echo inside the skull and come out as a sad melody.",[4]="If it is sad or lonely, the skull it wears shakes, and emits a plaintive and mournful sound.",[5]="It always wears the skull of its dead mother, so no one has any idea what its hidden face looks like.",[6]="It lost its mother after its birth. It wears its mother's skull, never revealing its true face.",[7]="CUBONE pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull the Pokémon wears are made by the tears it sheds.",[8]="CUBONE pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull the Pokémon wears are made by the tears it sheds.",[9]="It pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull it wears are from its tears.",[10]="It wears the skull of its dead mother on its head. When it becomes lonesome, it is said to cry loudly.",[11]="Because it never removes its skull helmet, no one has ever seen this Pokémon’s real face.",[12]="When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.",[13]="When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.",[14]="When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.",[15]="If it is sad or lonely, the skull it wears shakes and emits a plaintive and mournful sound.",[16]="It always wears the skull of its dead mother, so no one has any idea what its hidden face looks like.",[17]="When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.",[18]="When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.",[21]="When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.",[22]="When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.",[23]="It wears the skull of its dead mother on its head. When it becomes lonesome, it is said to cry loudly.",[24]="It always wears the skull of its dead mother, so no one has any idea what its hidden face looks like.",[25]="Cubone pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull the Pokémon wears are made by the tears it sheds.",[26]="Cubone pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull the Pokémon wears are made by the tears it sheds.",[27]="When it thinks of its deceased mother, it weeps loudly. Mandibuzz that hear its cries will attack it from the air.",[28]="The skull it wears on its head is that of its dead mother. According to some, it will evolve when it comes to terms with the pain of her death.",[29]="At night, it weeps loudly for its dead mother, but those cries only attract its natural enemy, Mandibuzz.",[30]="It wears its mother’s skull on its head, so no one knows what its bare face looks like. However, it’s clear that it’s always crying.",[31]="Wears the skull of its deceased mother. Its cries echo inside the skull and come out as a sad melody.",[32]="Wears the skull of its deceased mother. Its cries echo inside the skull and come out as a sad melody.",[33]="When the memory of its departed mother brings it to tears, its cries echo mournfully within the skull it wears on its head.",[34]="This Pokémon wears the skull of its deceased mother. Sometimes Cubone’s dreams make it cry, but each tear Cubone sheds makes it stronger."},es={[23]="Lleva puesto el cráneo de su madre. Cuando se siente solo se pone a gritar muy fuerte.",[24]="Siempre lleva la calavera de su difunta madre, así que nadie sabe cómo es su cara oculta.",[25]="A Cubone le ahoga la pena porque no volverá a ver jamás a su madre. La luna le recuerda a veces a ella, y se pone a llorar. Los churretes que tiene en el cráneo que lleva puesto son debidos a las lágrimas que derrama.",[26]="A Cubone le ahoga la pena porque no volverá a ver jamás a su madre. La luna le recuerda a veces a ella, y se pone a llorar. Los churretes que tiene en el cráneo que lleva puesto son debidos a las lágrimas que derrama.",[27]="Llora desconsoladamente por la pérdida de su madre. Los Mandibuzz que escuchan su llanto se lanzan en picado al ataque.",[28]="El cráneo que lleva en la cabeza pertenece a su madre. Se dice que evoluciona una vez que ha conseguido superar su pérdida.",[29]="Al caer la noche, rompe a llorar pensando en su difunta madre, lo que delata su presencia ante los Mandibuzz, sus enemigos naturales.",[30]="Al cubrir su rostro con el cráneo de su madre, su expresión queda velada. La única emoción que lo delata es su llanto constante.",[31]="Siempre lleva puesto el cráneo de su difunta madre. Su llanto resuena dentro como una triste melodía.",[32]="Siempre lleva puesto el cráneo de su difunta madre. Su llanto resuena dentro como una triste melodía.",[33]="Cuando llora al acordarse de su madre fallecida, su llanto resuena en el cráneo que lleva en la cabeza.",[34]="Lleva puesto el cráneo de su difunta madre. A veces llora en sueños, pero cada lágrima vertida le hace más fuerte."},pt="Este Pokémon usa o crânio da mãe falecida. Às vezes, os sonhos fazem Cubone chorar, mas cada lágrima que derrama o deixa mais forte."},evo={{s=104},{s=105,from=104,c={{t="level-up",lv=28},{t="level-up",lv=28,region=7,time="nig